  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• <strong>About our brand and products:</strong> We write and sell The First Chapters of books and novels. After 40 years of writing and hearing the same thing all the time 'I'd love to write a book but where do I start?' Well you now start with us, every First Chapter is exceptional and leaps off the page.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• <strong>What makes us different:&nbsp;</strong>As far as we know we are the only company that does this. We are extremely proud of what we do, as, let me tell you, its not easy.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• <strong>How affiliates can earn:&nbsp;</strong>We want the world to write more and we want our affiliates to want to work with us and promote the hell out of us. We give an awesome 50% commission on every First Chapter sold, that equates to £24.99 for every one sold.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>•<strong>&nbsp;How to promote us:&nbsp;</strong>Well, we believe everyone has at least one great novel or book inside them, most though don't know where to start. We write in all genres and specialise in murder, horror, thriller, romance and science fiction. However, budding writers, existing authors, publishing houses that need commissions, they also make a great Christmas or Birthday present. Always remember, modern day authors like J.K. Rowling has to start somewhere and now look where she is, just incredible.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>• Other information:&nbsp;</strong>Work with us not for us, our leader Will Green is a great guy and will help you all he can you can email him direct: hello@TheFirstChapter.Shop</p></div></div>",
